                            {
                                "example_id": "34581585-1c64-465b-9784-f6d1acf0526b",
                                "sense_id": "07c67808-b663-3c4b-ae9f-a9f6632a8fb2",
                                "text": "This [ore mixture] was bucked or cobbed down to a 'peasy' size (i.e. the size of a pea) or less, using a flat-bottomed bucking hammer, and then riddled into coarse peasy and finer (sand-sized) 'smitham' grades."
